msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_Hans\n"

msgid "Train mode"
msgstr "高铁模式"

msgid "High-speed train mode"
msgstr "高铁模式"

msgid "For fast trains: turns on the modem's high-speed-rail setting (5G) and a reconnect check every few seconds, so mobile data comes back as soon as the modem finds the network again instead of after a minute or more. Switching restarts the radio, so data stops for 15-40 s."
msgstr "适用于高铁等高速列车：开启调制解调器的高铁优化（5G），并每隔几秒检查一次连接。调制解调器重新找到网络后，移动数据会立即恢复，而不必等待一分钟以上。切换时会重启射频，移动数据将中断 15–40 秒。"

msgid "Applying a change..."
msgstr "正在应用更改…"

msgid "On"
msgstr "开"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "关"

msgid "No answer"
msgstr "无响应"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "4G only"
msgstr "仅 4G"

msgid "5G SA only"
msgstr "仅 5G SA"

msgid "5G NSA"
msgstr "5G NSA"

msgid "(set by train mode, was %s)"
msgstr "（由高铁模式设置，原为%s）"

msgid "Running: reacts to the modem at once, backup check every %d s"
msgstr "运行中：即时响应调制解调器事件，每 %d 秒备用检查一次"

msgid "Not running"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "Turn train mode on"
msgstr "开启高铁模式"

msgid "Turn train mode off"
msgstr "关闭高铁模式"

msgid "Modem HSR setting"
msgstr "调制解调器高铁优化"

msgid "Network mode"
msgstr "网络模式"

msgid "Fast reconnect"
msgstr "快速重连"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "These apply while train mode is on."
msgstr "以下选项仅在高铁模式开启时生效。"

msgid "High-speed-rail setting (5G)"
msgstr "高铁优化（5G）"

msgid "4G only avoids constant 5G handovers on routes where 5G keeps dropping. It uses the Network locks setting and puts back the previous mode when it is turned off."
msgstr "在 5G 频繁掉线的线路上，仅 4G 可避免反复切换 5G 小区。此选项使用“网络锁定”设置，关闭后会恢复之前的网络模式。"

msgid "Recent events"
msgstr "最近事件"

msgid "Nothing yet"
msgstr "暂无"

msgid "Failed: %s"
msgstr "失败：%s"

msgid "Saved, applying..."
msgstr "已保存，正在应用…"

msgid "Management connection lost"
msgstr "管理连接已中断"

msgid "Backup check"
msgstr "备用检查"

msgid "Every %d s"
msgstr "每 %d 秒"

msgid "Saved"
msgstr "已保存"

msgid "A dropped connection is redialled the moment the modem announces it. The backup check catches what is never announced, such as a modem that stopped answering. Each check sends a few AT commands that other pages have to wait for, so shorter is not better."
msgstr "调制解调器一报告断线就会立即重拨。备用检查用于发现不会被报告的情况，例如调制解调器停止响应。每次检查都会发送几条 AT 命令，其他页面需要排队等待，因此间隔并非越短越好。"
